ser menu choice ascii 1-3 OR 9) T: BEGIN                                                            'KEY ASCII 1 ASCII 4 WITHIN                                     LKEY @ ASCII 9 = OR                                            UNTIL  LKEY @ T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \ GAMEOPCASE RESUMEGAME                                                                                                         HEAD: RESUMEGAME ( -- \ resume game in progress)                T: RESUME ON T;                                                                                                                 CASE GAMEOPCASE ( n -- \ execute game option chosen)              ASCII 1 IS SAVEGAME                                             ASCII 2 IS RESUMEGAME                                           ASCII 3 IS SET.DISPLAY.MODE                                   OTHERS BYE             \ exit without saving                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \ >GAMEOPTIONS                                                                                                                  HEAD: >GAMEOPTIONS                                              T: ( -- \ do set up for game options procedure)                   ESCDISABLE                     \ turn off esc key path          FLUSH                          \ save virtual 